# The Kubernetes daemons, k3s (with its kubelet) and CRI-O, out of
# system.slice: Slice=kube.slice in their units' drop-ins. Pods aren't
# here: the kubelet puts them in kubepods.slice, next to this one.
# No resource limits: the kubelet's systemReserved
# (usr/lib/rancher/k3s/kubelet.conf.d/20-my-kubelet.conf)
# keeps room for this slice and system.slice by capping kubepods.slice.
# See systemd.slice(5) and
# https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/administer-cluster/reserve-compute-resources/
[Unit]
Description=Kubernetes daemons (k3s, CRI-O)
Documentation=man:systemd.slice(5)
